      "body": "- `qwen_gdn_linear_attn.py`: take the AITER GDN decode fast path only when the conv state is not dim-first (`VLLM_SSM_CONV_STATE_LAYOUT=DS`)\n- `test_gdn_rocm_layout_dispatch.py`: check that a DS conv state routes decode to the generic path\n\n`:amd: (MI300) Hybrid SSM NixlConnector PD accuracy` fails on every weekly AITER-on build ([14875](https://buildkite.com/vllm/amd-ci/builds/14875), [15350](https://buildkite.com/vllm/amd-ci/builds/15350)) with `APIConnectionError`: the Qwen3.5 decode server dies on an `AssertionError` in AITER's `fused_reshape_causal_conv1d_update_single_token`, which still requires `conv_state.stride(-2) == 1`. #53623 removed the `gqa_interleaved_layout` guard, so flat-qkvz models like Qwen3.5 now take `_forward_core_decode_aiter` even when the test sets `VLLM_SSM_CONV_STATE_LAYOUT=DS`, whose conv state is (blocks, dim, state_len) with the feature stride 3. Falling back to the generic path for DS, as the KDA path already does, avoids the stale AITER assertion; dropping that assertion in AITER is a separate follow-up.\n\nOn MI350X with the AITER v0.1.26 pin, Qwen3.5-0.8B with AITER and the DS layout fails on main with the same assertion and passes with this change in 3/3 runs, with output byte-identical to AITER with the SD layout; the new dispatch test fails without the change and passes with it.\n\nAI assistance (Claude Code) was used to draft this change. Every line was reviewed by the submitter.\n\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63558?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795508265&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63558&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63558&signature=3895d69d2932d165f653843e122d9d8a23776a015040933f4bf9867a73a7b90c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63558?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795508273&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63558&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63558&signature=c10aa25d46ec3abbd63e315a6e571c73e765b687f289dae6e3f7840379fc19ae\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-